# Expo / React Native
.expo/
*.log
.metro-health-check*

# Generated native projects (CNG — see mobile/app.config.js).
# These patterns are anchored to this directory, so the native source of
# the local Expo module under mobile/modules/ stays tracked. `expo-doctor`
# reports this as an over-broad rule; that is a false positive, and
# `git check-ignore mobile/modules/foreground-service/android/build.gradle`
# shows the file is not ignored.
mobile/android/
mobile/ios/

